+# Already done elsewhere: 2D+E1 = baseline, 2D+E3 = C2, tube+E3 = C5 (nine_rest).
+# Order: tier 1 (must have), tier 2, tier 3; inside a tier seed 42 first, so every config gets 1 seed early.
